{"availability":"available","full":"luckyyyyy/miu2d","name":"miu2d","description":"Miu2D is a 2D RPG game engine built with Rust + TypeScript + React + Canvas, designed for the Web platform. 剑侠情缘2/月影传说/新剑侠情缘网页复刻版","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":477,"forks":94,"created":"2026-01-25T13:54:11Z","updated":"2026-09-06T06:40:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://miu2d.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://miu2d.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.023Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.023Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.023Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.023Z","stars":477,"forks":94}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A from-scratch 2D ARPG engine — raw WebGL, zero game-framework dependencies","Miu2D is a 176,000-line 2D ARPG engine written in TypeScript and Rust, rendering through raw WebGL with no dependency on Unity, Godot, Phaser, PixiJS, or any other game framework. Every subsystem — sprite batching, A pathfinding, binary format decoders, scripting VM, weather particles, screen effects — is implemented from first principles.","As a proof of concept, Miu2D has been used to rebuild three classic Kingsoft (西山居) wuxia RPGs, all fully playable in any modern browser."],"features":["Full control over the render loop — a SpriteBatcher coalesces 4,800 map tile draws into 1–5 WebGL draw calls; a RectBatcher reduces 300 weather particles to a single call; a real-time lighting pass composites per-entity…","No abstraction tax — no unused scene graph, no 3D math overhead, no framework event model to work around.","Rust-speed where it matters — A pathfinding runs in 0.2 ms via WASM with obstacle data written directly into linear memory (no serialization, no FFI copy).","Clean architecture for study — an 8-level class hierarchy (Sprite → CharacterBase → Movement → Combat → Character → PlayerBase → PlayerCombat → Player) with clear separation of concerns, ideal for understanding how a…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/luckyyyyy/miu2d/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e10db2a21797b670baade613225e760393459e4a63820a383e442bea39622e3a","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.153Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.153Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A from-scratch 2D ARPG engine — raw WebGL, zero game-framework dependencies","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/luckyyyyy/miu2d/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Clean architecture for study — an 8-level class hierarchy (Sprite → CharacterBase → Movement → Combat → Character → PlayerBase → PlayerCombat → Player) with clear separation of concerns, ideal for understanding how a…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/luckyyyyy/miu2d/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e10db2a21797b670baade613225e760393459e4a63820a383e442bea39622e3a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/luckyyyyy/miu2d/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.154Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-06T06:40:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/luckyyyyy/miu2d/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:09.155Z","hash":"e10db2a21797b670baade613225e760393459e4a63820a383e442bea39622e3a","originalBytes":20921,"storedBytes":20921,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["game","engine","miu2d","map","editor","npc","wasm","web","lua","magic","sprite","player","rust","system","effects","full","audio","data","packages","rendering","character","original","script","webgl","combat","format","make","pnpm","real-time","shared","weather","action","asf","commands","dev","memory","public","screenshot","binary","custom","kingsoft","level","mobile","movement","raw","react","renderer","resource","server","slots","swords","via","async","files","interact","legends","lighting","modern","modules","object","particles","pathfinding","rpg","scene","screen","scripts","typescript","wasmoon","additive","backend","behavior","calls","cl